{"v": 1, "key": "cu-cu13", "cards": [{"id": "u5.t.mushroom", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">MUSH<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">room<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"mushroom\" data-audio=\"audio/mushroom.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: mushroom\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"photos/u5-mushroom.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\" alt=\"Porcini mushrooms (Boletus edulis): the cap and stalk are the part of the fungus that makes spores.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Porcini mushrooms (Boletus edulis): the cap and stalk are the part of the fungus that makes spores.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">美味牛肝菌：菌盖和菌柄是真菌产生孢子的部分。<\/span><small class=\"cred\">Photo: Holger Krisp · <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0\" rel=\"license noopener\">CC BY 3.0<\/a> · <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gemeine_Steinpilz_(Boletus_edulis).JPG\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons<\/a><\/small><\/figcaption><\/figure><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"mushroom\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M60 50 Q100 15 140 50 Z\" class=\"f2 k\"/><rect x=\"92\" y=\"50\" width=\"16\" height=\"30\" rx=\"4\" class=\"f6\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"80\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"100\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"100\" class=\"\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"105\" class=\"\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"12\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">fruiting body (the part we eat)<\/text><text x=\"40\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">hidden mycelium<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">The visible reproductive structure of some fungi. The main body is the hidden mycelium.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>蘑菇<\/b>：某些真菌可见的繁殖结构，真正的主体是隐藏的菌丝体。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A mushroom is like an apple on a tree.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">蘑菇像树上的苹果，主体在地下。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: What is a mushroom to the fungus?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Its reproductive structure (fruiting body).<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u5.t.budding", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">BUD<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ding<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"budding\" data-audio=\"audio/budding.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: budding\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"photos/u5-budding.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" alt=\"Yeast under a microscope. Several cells have a small bud growing from one side.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Yeast under a microscope. Several cells have a small bud growing from one side.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">显微镜下的酵母。好几个细胞一侧正长出小芽。<\/span><small class=\"cred\">Photo: Masur · Public domain · <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:S_cerevisiae_under_DIC_microscopy.jpg\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons<\/a><\/small><\/figcaption><\/figure><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"budding\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><ellipse cx=\"70\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"30\" ry=\"26\" class=\"f3 k\"/><circle cx=\"108\" cy=\"50\" r=\"13\" class=\"f3 k\"/><ellipse cx=\"160\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"20\" class=\"f3 k\"/><line x1=\"125.0\" y1=\"55.0\" x2=\"138.0\" y2=\"55.0\"/><polygon points=\"138.0,55.0 133.5,57.2 133.5,52.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">bud grows, then separates<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">Asexual reproduction in which a small outgrowth pinches off to form a new cell.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>出芽生殖<\/b>：无性繁殖方式：一个小突起脱落后成为新个体。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">bud = a young outgrowth.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">bud = 幼芽。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Which fungus reproduces by budding?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Yeast.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u5.t.fragmentation", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">frag<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">men<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">TA<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">tion<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"fragmentation\" data-audio=\"audio/fragmentation.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: fragmentation\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"fragmentation\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"46.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" strok