stion", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term sm\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"sy\">ex<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">tra<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">CEL<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">lu<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">lar<\/span> <span class=\"sy\">di<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"st\">GES<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">tion<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"extracellular digestion\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: extracellular digestion\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"extracellular digestion\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"52.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Hyphae<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"63.5\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">release<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"74.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">enzymes<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"46.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Food<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">breaks<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">down<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"80.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">outside<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"58.05\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Nutrients<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"68.25\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">absorbed<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">Digesting food outside the body by releasing enzymes, then absorbing the nutrients.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>胞外消化<\/b>：向体外释放酶消化食物，再把养分吸收进来。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">extra = outside, cellular = cell.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">extra = 外面。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Where does digestion happen in a fungus?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Outside its body, before absorption.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u5.t.enzyme", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">EN<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">zyme<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"enzyme\" data-audio=\"audio/enzyme.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: enzyme\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"enzyme\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Big food<\/text><text x=\"32\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">molecule<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Enzyme<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">acts<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Small<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"69.1\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">pieces<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">A protein that speeds up a chemical reaction, such as breaking down food.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>酶<\/b>：加快化学反应的蛋白质，如分解食物。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">en = in, zyme = leaven (yeast): the name means &quot;in yeast&quot;.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">en = 在……里，zyme = 酵母：名字意为「在酵母中」。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: What does an enzyme do?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">It speeds up a chemical reaction.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u5.t.saprotroph", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term mid\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">SAP<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">ro<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">troph<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"saprotroph\" data-tts=\"1\" aria-label=\"Listen: saprotroph\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><figure class=\"photo\"><img src=\"photos/u5-saprotroph.webp\" width=\"720\" height=\"480\" alt=\"Tinder fungus growing on a dead tree trunk. It feeds by digesting the dead wood.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Tinder fungus growing on a dead tree trunk. It feeds by digesting the dead wood.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">长在枯树干上的木蹄层孔菌。它靠消化枯木为生。<\/span><small class=\"cred\">Photo: Agnes Monkelbaan · <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0\" rel=\"license noopener\">CC BY-SA 4.0<\/a> · <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Echte_tonderzwam_(Fomes_fomentarius)_25-12-2020_(actm.)_05.jpg\" rel=\"noopener\">Wikimedia Commons<\/a><\/small><\/figcaption><\/figure><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"saprotroph\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"63.5\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Dead log<\/text><line x1=\"59.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"73.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"73.0,60.0 68.5,62.2 68.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"52.3\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Fungus<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"63.5\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">digests<\/text><text x=\"100\" y=\"74.7\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">it<\/text><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"141.0\" y2=\"60.0\"/><polygon points=\"141.0,60.0 136.5,62.2 136.5,57.8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"142\" y=\"34\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"168\" y=\"52.95\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Nutrients<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"63.15\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">return to<\/text><text x=\"168\" y=\"73.35\" font-size=\"9.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">soil<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">An organism that feeds on dead or decaying matter.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>腐生生物<\/b>：以死亡或腐烂的有机物为食的生物。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">sapros = rotten, troph = feeding.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">sapros = 腐烂，troph = 营养。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Name a saprotroph.<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">A mushroom or bread mold.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}, {"id": "u5.t.parasite", "f": "<div class=\"bt-front\"><div class=\"term-line\"><span class=\"term big\" lang=\"en\"><span class=\"st\">PAR<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">a<\/span><i class=\"dot\">·<\/i><span class=\"sy\">site<\/span><\/span><button type=\"button\" class=\"say\" data-say=\"parasite\" data-audio=\"audio/parasite.m4a\" aria-label=\"Listen: parasite\" title=\"Listen\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🔊<\/span><\/button><\/div><\/div>", "b": "<div class=\"bt-back\"><svg class=\"pic\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"parasite\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f1\"/><text x=\"51\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Parasite<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">gains food or a<\/text><text x=\"51\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">home<\/text><rect x=\"104\" y=\"28\" width=\"90\" height=\"64\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f3\"/><text x=\"149\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">Host<\/text><text x=\"149\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">is harmed<\/text><\/svg><p class=\"def\"><span lang=\"en\">An organism that lives on or in a host and harms it.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"zhdef\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\"><b>寄生生物<\/b>：生活在宿主体表或体内并损害宿主的生物。<\/span><\/p><p class=\"hook\"><b>🧠<\/b> <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">para = beside, sitos = food. Eats beside you.<\/span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">para = 旁边，sitos = 食物。<\/span><\/p><details class=\"chk\"><summary><span lang=\"en\">Quick check: Does a parasite harm its host?<\/span><\/summary><p class=\"chk-a\" lang=\"en\">Yes.<\/p><\/details><\/div>"}], "quiz": [{"id": "cu.q.u5.t.mushroom", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“The visible reproductive structure of some fungi. The main body is the hidden mycelium.”<\/i>", "opts": ["basidium", "mushroom", "pioneer species", "septum"], "a": 1, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>mushroom<\/b>: The visible reproductive structure of some fungi. The main body is the hidden mycelium. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">蘑菇<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u5.t.budding", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“Asexual reproduction in which a small outgrowth pinches off to form a new cell.”<\/i>", "opts": ["nutrient cycling", "pioneer species", "gills", "budding"], "a": 3, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>budding<\/b>: Asexual reproduction in which a small outgrowth pinches off to form a new cell. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">出芽生殖<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u5.t.fragmentation", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“Reproduction when a piece of a fungus breaks off and grows into a new fungus.”<\/i>", "opts": ["mycorrhiza", "sac fungi", "lichen", "fragmentation"], "a": 3, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>fragmentation<\/b>: Reproduction when a piece of a fungus breaks off and grows into a new fungus. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">断裂生殖<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u5.t.extracellular-digestion", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“Digesting food outside the body by releasing enzymes, then absorbing the nutrients.”<\/i>", "opts": ["extracellular digestion", "mycorrhiza", "ascus", "septum"], "a": 0, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>extracellular digestion<\/b>: Digesting food outside the body by releasing enzymes, then absorbing the nutrients. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">胞外消化<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u5.t.enzyme", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“A protein that speeds up a chemical reaction, such as breaking down food.”<\/i>", "opts": ["nutrient cycling", "budding", "lichen", "enzyme"], "a": 3, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>enzyme<\/b>: A protein that speeds up a chemical reaction, such as breaking down food. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">酶<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u5.t.saprotroph", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“An organism that feeds on dead or decaying matter.”<\/i>", "opts": ["lichen", "yeast", "saprotroph", "gills"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>saprotroph<\/b>: An organism that feeds on dead or decaying matter. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">腐生生物<\/span>", "whys": null}, {"id": "cu.q.u5.t.parasite", "q": "Which term matches this definition?<br><i>“An organism that lives on or in a host and harms it.”<\/i>", "opts": ["budding", "extracellular digestion", "parasite", "mold"], "a": 2, "hint": null, "ans": null, "why": "<b>parasite<\/b>: An organism that lives on or in a host and harms it. <span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">寄生生物<\/span>", "whys": null}]}